{{!
    @template tool_vae/organisation_followed

    The tab of the candidates the reader follows: the box that says there is nobody, or the form that narrows the counts to a
    bloc (with its sentence once a bloc is chosen) and the table of the candidates. The form is written here, on one logical
    line: a comment carries each line break of the template, so that no space is drawn where the old code wrote none.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\organisation_followed. The template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text, label and address is escaped (double braces). Two keys are HTML, placed as they are (triple braces):
    nonehtml, the box drawn by tool_vae/organisation_notice, and tablehtml, the table drawn by tool_vae/table.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * nonehtml - string, HTML: the box that says there is nobody to follow, or empty
    * filter - null, or {action, label, options, apply, filtered}: the form, each option {value, label, selected}, filtered
      null or {label}, the sentence that says the counts are narrowed
    * tablehtml - string, HTML: the table of the candidates, or empty

    Example context (json):
    {
        "nonehtml": "",
        "filter": {
            "action": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/organisation.php",
            "label": "Count the declarations on",
            "options": [
                {"value": "0", "label": "All the records", "selected": false},
                {"value": "RNCP100|BC01", "label": "RNCP100 — bloc BC01", "selected": true}
            ],
            "apply": "Show the counts",
            "filtered": {"label": "The counts are limited to the declarations on RNCP100 — bloc BC01."}
        },
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>Camille Durand</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
{{{nonehtml}}}{{#filter}}<form method="get" action="{{action}}"><label for="candidatesbloc">{{label}}</label> {{!
}}<select id="candidatesbloc" class="select form-select menubloc" name="bloc">{{#options}}{{!
}}<option{{#selected}} selected="selected"{{/selected}} value="{{value}}">{{label}}</option>{{/options}}</select>{{!
}}<input type="hidden" name="tab" value="followed" /> {{!
}}<input type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary" value="{{apply}}" /></form>{{!
}}{{#filtered}}<p>{{label}}</p>{{/filtered}}{{/filter}}{{{tablehtml}}}
